    Remove PR build link comment workflow (#8168)
    
    The workflow listened for runs of a workflow named "Test Opencast". That
    workflow was renamed to "Deploy » Opencast" a year ago, so the comment
    has not been posted since. Even before that, it only worked for pull
    requests from branches within this repository, since the workflow_run
    event carries no pull request information for forks. In practice this
    meant Dependabot pull requests only.
    
    Nobody missed it, so remove it along with the workflow artifact upload
    of the all-in-one distribution which only existed to be linked from that
    comment. The nightly upload to S3 is unaffected.
    
